  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLACSO Knowledge for a Sustainable World 2013-2018 - CLACSO Kunskap f&#xf6;r en h&#xe5;llbar v&#xe4;rld 2013-2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CLACSO Kunskap f&#xf6;r en h&#xe5;llbar v&#xe4;rld 2013-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program support to the Latin American Council for Social Sciences     (CLACSO). The Council works with competitive research grants,         regional thematic working groups, postgraduate courses, relations to  the public sector and the civil society, publication and              dissemination of research results etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programst&#xf6;d till det Latinamerikanska forskningsr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r             samh&#xe4;llsvetenskaper (CLACSO). R&#xe5;det arbetar med konkurrensutsatta     forskningsst&#xf6;d, regionala tematiska forskargrupper,                   forskarutbildningskurser, relationer till offentliga sektorn och      civila samh&#xe4;llet, publicering och spridning av forskningsresultat     etc.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote research and postgraduate teaching, strengthening cooperation among researches and institutions in the field of Social Sciences.

Increase the use of Social Sciences quality research by policy makers, civil society and social organizations in order to contribute finding solutions to important problems in the region and thus supporting the construction of a democratic society, equitable and socially sustainable.

To disseminate academic production of Latin American and Caribbean researchers in support of public policy and governmental management, in order to contribute to democratic consolidation, promotion of human rights, sustainable development and culture of peace.</narrative>
  </description>
